{"name": "Jammed", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Draw roads. Run the simulation. Fix the traffic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw roads and bridges, connect growing districts, and watch your city come alive. Design efficient interchanges and prevent your city from becoming Jammed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Draw Your Road Network</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place districts and draw one-way roads and bridges by hand. Every connection changes how traffic moves through your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/d8926d375752fae0cb6f186a04b90366.poster.avif?t=1784290972\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/d8926d375752fae0cb6f186a04b90366.webm?t=1784290972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/d8926d375752fae0cb6f186a04b90366.mp4?t=1784290972\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Watch Traffic Come Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start the simulation and watch hundreds of vehicles travel through your network in real time. Efficient roads keep the city moving. Bad designs create bottlenecks and traffic jams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/63e4de073061eeb0354f7a0c5928d4d9.poster.avif?t=1784290972\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/63e4de073061eeb0354f7a0c5928d4d9.webm?t=1784290972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/63e4de073061eeb0354f7a0c5928d4d9.mp4?t=1784290972\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Growing City Never Stops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New districts appear as you play. Roads that worked minutes ago may suddenly become overloaded. Redesign intersections, reroute traffic, and keep the city moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/1ae3ce6e883fe5bb5493d875ba6f1c7b.poster.avif?t=1784290972\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/1ae3ce6e883fe5bb5493d875ba6f1c7b.webm?t=1784290972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/1ae3ce6e883fe5bb5493d875ba6f1c7b.mp4?t=1784290972\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Massive Interchanges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect islands, cross rivers, and create increasingly complex road systems across handcrafted maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/de9116132c157c1c9a13752a3e4ea665.poster.avif?t=1784290972\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/de9116132c157c1c9a13752a3e4ea665.webm?t=1784290972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/extras/de9116132c157c1c9a13752a3e4ea665.mp4?t=1784290972\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw one-way roads freely on the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build bridges to cross rivers and connect islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch traffic flow through your network in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new districts as your city grows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple handcrafted maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements and Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Export your best traffic solutions as GIFs</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "You are a traffic engineer. Draw roads and bridges, connect growing districts, and watch your city come alive. Design efficient interchanges and avoid traffic jams.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831170/d1010ddb52d4d16b7701042f7196d9b67f9148da/header.jpg?t=1784290972", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Transportation", "Strategy", "Management", "Casual", "Building"], "developers": "Szaloki Sandor", "publishers": "Szaloki Sandor", "release_date": "Jul 17, 2026", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "4831170", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/pvEFRwbD3nY", "first_seen": 1784239200.0, "review_rank": 269}